---
// Hero: title, hero line, CTAs, status readout, CSS neutron-star + spacetime grid.
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-[92vh] items-center overflow-hidden" aria-label="Hero">
  <!-- Spacetime grid that bends toward the compact object -->
  <div class="spacetime-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <!-- Central compact object -->
  <div class="compact-object" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="co-core"></div>
    <div class="co-glow"></div>
    <div class="co-ring"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-edge relative z-10 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr] lg:items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="reveal mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted">
        <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-amber"></span>
        Field guide to the edge of the map
      </p>
      <h1 class="reveal font-display text-5xl font-bold leading-[0.95] text-paper text-glow sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
        WHERE PHYSICS<br />STARTS SWEATING
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-paper/85">
        There are places in the universe where our best equations still work, but they start breathing hard.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-muted">
        We can time pulsars, detect gravitational waves, map galaxies, and model spacetime. But neutron stars, black holes, dark energy, quantum gravity, and the early universe still hide questions modern physics has not fully answered.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="#observatory"
          class="rounded-xl bg-neutron px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold text-void transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03]"
        >
          Begin the Descent
        </a>
        <a
          href="#neutron-star-problem"
          class="rounded-xl border border-line px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold text-paper transition-colors hover:border-neutron hover:text-neutron"
        >
          Open the Neutron Star Problem
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Status readout panel -->
    <div class="reveal glass rounded-2xl p-5 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line pb-2 text-muted">
        <span>STATUS READOUT</span>
        <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-neutron"></span>
      </div>
      <dl class="space-y-2.5">
        <div class="flex justify-between"><dt class="text-muted">KNOWN PHYSICS</dt><dd class="text-neutron">ACTIVE</dd></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between"><dt class="text-muted">UNKNOWN PHYSICS</dt><dd class="text-amber">DETECTED</dd></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between"><dt class="text-muted">CONFIDENCE</dt><dd class="text-paper">DEPENDS WHO YOU ASK</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Scroll cue -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 z-10 -translate-x-1/2 text-muted" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="scroll-cue mx-auto h-9 w-5 rounded-full border border-line">
      <span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutron"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .spacetime-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -20% -10% -40% -10%;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(79, 156, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(79, 156, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    transform: perspective(700px) rotateX(62deg) translateY(10%);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 70% 45%, black, transparent 75%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 70% 45%, black, transparent 75%);
    opacity: calc(0.5 + var(--confidence) * 0.5);
  }

  .compact-object {
    position: absolute;
    right: 14%;
    top: 38%;
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .compact-object { right: -10%; top: 20%; opacity: 0.45; }
  }
  .co-core {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 42%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 35%, #ffffff, #8cc0ff 40%, #4f9cff 70%);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 30px 6px rgba(140, 192, 255, 0.9),
      0 0 80px 24px rgba(79, 156, 255, 0.5);
  }
  .co-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.35), transparent 60%);
    animation: pulse-glow 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .co-ring {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(140, 170, 255, 0.25);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(79, 156, 255, 0.2);
    animation: spin 28s linear infinite;
  }
  .co-ring::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 14%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 180, 84, 0.4);
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .scroll-cue { display: grid; place-items: start center; padding-top: 6px; }
  .scroll-cue span { animation: cue 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }

  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes pulse-glow { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; } 50% { opacity: 1; } }
  @keyframes cue { 0% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; } 70% { transform: translateY(12px); opacity: 0; } 100% { opacity: 0; } }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .co-glow, .co-ring, .scroll-cue span { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
